    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d731">

                <pb facs="0701" n="689" xml:id="pg689"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.1561/26: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Minister in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Walton</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-12-16T21:00:00-04:00">December 16,
                            1943—9 p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>139. The Department does not understand, reference your telegram no. 211,
                    December 13, what is meant by “a municipal corporation with obligation
                    appertaining to such corporation”. Please elaborate, particularly as regards how
                    Americans could participate in a Liberian municipal corporation.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
